tasks.description:
Create `src/types/diary.ts` with all shared type definitions from spec §4:

- `FileStat`: { path: string, insertions: number, deletions: number }
- `Commit`: { sha: string, subject: string, body: string, author: string, timestamp: Date, filesChanged: FileStat[], insertions: number, deletions: number }
- `CommitCategory`: union type of 'feat' | 'fix' | 'refactor' | 'docs' | 'chore' | 'test' | 'style' | 'perf' | 'build' | 'ci' | 'other'
- `DaySegment`: 'morning' | 'afternoon' | 'evening' | 'night'
- `CategorizedCommit`: Commit & { category: CommitCategory, tilItems: string[], daySegment: DaySegment }
- `TilItem`: { text: string, repoName: string, sha: string }
- `RepoEntry`: { repoPath: string, repoName: string, commits: CategorizedCommit[] }
- `DiaryEntry`: { date: string, repos: RepoEntry[], tilItems: TilItem[] }
- `CliArgs`: { repoPaths: string[], date: string, outputDir: string }

All exports must use `export type`. Named exports only, no default exports. Use `.js` extensions in any imports.
